<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車こぐ.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "800" "3000" "WAIT"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\桜道夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "ネジの壊れたロボット.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "30"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>I went on pedaling the bicycle at full speed.
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was because I did not want the people I passed to see my face.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was close to crying under the moonlight.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, the tears were already falling.<PG>
Pedaling the bicycle, I apologized to <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> over and over in my heart.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中思い出.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> matters to me, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> matters to me a whole lot too. So don't go doing anything reckless."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I know that! Please trust me!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> was worried for my safety and told me to stop investigating.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And in answer to that, I told her to trust me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\桜道夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
But, I had already made up my mind.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I simply could not forgive the culprit who had made <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> sad.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had no intention at all of stopping the investigation.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right now, I could still hold off from acting and make it as though I had never <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="だま">deceived</STYLE> her.<PG>
Even so, I will not stop.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I am sorry. I told a lie.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="だま">deceived</STYLE> <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is not some light lie.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> was worried about my safety, and yet I am about to <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="ほご">go back on</STYLE> it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had a belief that I would never do anything like <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="だま">deceiving</STYLE> people who matter to me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\教室.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Ever since I was small, I was good at one thing only: studying.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From before I entered elementary school, my teachers and my parents alike praised me, calling me a genius, a genius.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Being good at schoolwork did not mean I had done anything special.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It is probably the thing they call talent, but I think of it as one of my traits.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And I had no intention of getting smug just because I was good at schoolwork, either.<PG>
But maybe someone like me was hard to approach, and I never got anyone I could call a friend.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
More than scoring well on tests or being praised by a teacher, the wish to be inside the circle with everyone else was stronger in me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If my test scores were about the same as everyone else's, would I be able to get inside that circle?<PG>
Once, I deliberately got a bad score on a test.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was a bad score for me: a score a little above average.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家リビング思い出.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
When I got home and showed her the score on the test, Mom knitted her <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="みけん">brow</STYLE> sadly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="3">Erina</STYLE>, what's wrong? Did something upsetting happen? Tell me anything, won't you?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The situation did not change.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Far from it: I had gone and made Mom sad.<PG>
I stopped getting bad scores, and on the next test I scored as I always did.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Mom was very happy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At that moment, a grin from ear to ear came to my face on its own.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Oh my, <STYLE ID="3">Erina</STYLE>, that smile is really nice."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see. Even just this much changes the impression you give quite a lot.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\教室.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Ever since then, I had the habit of grinning from ear to ear.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then, strangely enough, classmates began to gather around me of their own accord.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was happy. I was very happy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But...<PG>
Even so, my nature did not change.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was bad at closing the distance myself, and somewhere in me I kept people at a distance.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Strictly speaking, I think I could not fully trust the people around me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What part of me is everyone looking at?<PG>
If it is only the smile, then that is nothing more than the surface.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If they cannot accept the personality that is me, it might all go back to how it was.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So I simply could not lay myself bare to the people around me.<PG>
The decisive reason I felt that way was that everyone called me "<STYLE ID="3">Erina-chan</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Friends call each other by name with no honorific, or call each other by some strange nickname, and with me there was none of that at all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It may be selfish of me, but for someone with oddly sharp powers of observation, that was what made me feel the gap between myself and everyone around me.<PG>
I know the reason.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The title of "the genius girl" that had stuck to me at some point, the overestimation in it, and the fear that because of them the distance between me and everyone around me would widen.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For me, "the genius girl" was, far from a strength, a complex.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But if I stopped that, I would make Mom sad again.<PG>
That attitude of mine must have come across to the people around me as well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I got a few people I could talk to a little, but not enough to call them friends; my nature stayed as gloomy as ever, and only the smile took on a life of its own.<PG>
I could not step closer to the people around me and I could not draw back either; the wish for friends, the fear of showing myself, and I was in <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="くもん">torment</STYLE> in the middle of those conflicts.<PG>
{MESOFF "2000"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
And then, once I was in middle school, I met <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>, who happened to be in the same club as me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"So you're </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. Nice to meet you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even the upperclassmen called me "<STYLE ID="3">Erina-chan</STYLE>," and yet the first person ever to call me by name with no honorific was <STYLE ID="2">that person</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"The genius girl? Yeah, I've heard of that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Hey, hey, more to the point, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I have a friend called </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, and―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For me, who had only ever come into contact with people who braced themselves at the reputation of "the genius girl," <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>'s manner was fresh, and it let me feel no wall.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>, who always dealt with me as an equal, I gradually became able to show myself.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
And through <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> I got to know <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>, and it was the same with her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"So this is the genius girl </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! Huh, she's seriously tiny!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"T... tiny...?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey now, are </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> eating proper meals? Is all the nutrition going to nothing but your brain, so you stopped growing?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I-I'm eating properly... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">I may not look it, but I</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">am quite... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">uh... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">a big eater..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み全身.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh? What was that? Your voice is too quiet, I can't hear you!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">I...</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> I really am a big eater!!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ho! All right, in honor of meeting you, I'll act like a senpai and treat you to something at Zahha! Show me what this big eating of </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s is!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中思い出.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-sama</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... I apologize. Please give me a break..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you're amaaazing! You could enter an eating contest, couldn't you!?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Damn... this month's allowance...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! I treated you to all this, so when I'm free you'd better keep me company!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Right, right, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> isn't in a club, so she's got a fair amount of free time, hasn't she."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...! You two, show a little more respect for your elders!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh? </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, you're a third-year!? You aren't the least bit composed, are you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh...! Aren't you a mouthy one, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Like this, before I was aware of anything, the chances to lay myself bare increased.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I like who I am now very much.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have been able to discover a self I never knew until now, and every day is fun.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There are people who accept that, and it is very much fun.<PG>
That I could become the way I am now is thanks to <STYLE ID="2">that person</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And that I was brought together with <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> is also thanks to <STYLE ID="2">that person</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
These people at least, I would live without ever doing anything like <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="だま">deceiving</STYLE> them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was the vow I made.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\桜道夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I am sorry... I am sorry...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right now, I must have the face I had before I learned the smile, back in those lonely days.<PG>
I turned to the moon and grinned from ear to ear as hard as I possibly could.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's all right... it will surely be all right.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A time will come when the three of us can meet like this, smiling, again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I chose this road for that.<PG>
I pedaled the bicycle hard.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
